OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe east
OL,6,Fwill be mainly dry with clear spells
OL,7,Fthis evening while a few showers
OL,8,Faffect the west. Overnight showers
OL,9,Fwill become a little more widespread,
OL,10,Fsome heavy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA cloudier day with more
OL,13,Ffrequent showers, some on the heavy
OL,14,Fside, best of the brighter spells
OL,15,Ftowards Inverbervie.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMainly
OL,18,Fdry with sunny spells on Sunday.
OL,19,FCloudier Monday with patchy rain.
OL,20,FEarly rain clearing on Tuesday then
OL,21,Fsunshine and showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
